        "y0": 0.35362504943148243,
        "x1": 0.822596240640615,
        "y1": 0.37436072318814184
      },
      "text": "ZONE 2 [Z2]   Steady 65 to 75% of your maximum. Fairly easy pace. Easy enough so that you could breathe just through your nose if you wanted to.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
